1
00:00:00,873 --> 00:00:02,453
(Leonard:)Whatever.

2
00:00:03,459 --> 00:00:06,299
(Leonard:)- You have to do something about it.
- Why?

3
00:00:06,462 --> 00:00:08,212
(Leonard:)Because she's your sister.

4
00:00:09,423 --> 00:00:11,133
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,720
(Sheldon:)Yes, we shared a uterus
for nine months.

6
00:00:13,886 --> 00:00:17,096
(Sheldon:)But since then, we've pretty much gone
our own separate ways.

7
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:20,266
Okay, consider this.

8
00:00:20,434 --> 00:00:24,024
(Leonard:)With your father gone,
it is your responsibility...

9
00:00:24,188 --> 00:00:27,478
(Leonard:)...to make sure
that Missy chooses a suitable mate.

10
00:00:29,234 --> 00:00:31,574
(Sheldon:)I hadn't considered that.

11
00:00:31,862 --> 00:00:33,572
(Sheldon:)We do share DNA.

12
00:00:33,739 --> 00:00:35,869
(Sheldon:)So there is the possibility,
however remote...

13
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:39,413
(Sheldon:)...that resting in her loins
is the potential for another individual...

14
00:00:39,578 --> 00:00:42,368
(Sheldon:)...as remarkable as myself.

15
00:00:42,539 --> 00:00:47,539
(Leonard:)Exactly. And you owe it to yourself
and to posterity...

16
00:00:47,711 --> 00:00:51,591
(Leonard:)...to protect the genetic integrity
of your sister's future offspring.

17
00:00:53,592 --> 00:00:57,262
(Sheldon:)You're right. If someone wants
to get at Missy's fallopian tubes...

18
00:00:57,429 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)...they'll have to go through me.

